  ("This year we didn't celebrate Yalda Night because my grandmother was sick.", "امسال شب یلدا را جشن نگرفتیم، چون مادربزرگم مریض بود.", "emsâl shab-e yaldâ râ jashn nagereftim, chon mâdarbozorgam mariz bud."),
